  "contract": "A Mythical Cache (Mythic 1, 2093952) gives one random level 60 Mythic 1 item. ChrSpecs.dbc lists a specialization's primary stats in priority order (fields 8-10): Witch Hunter Houndmaster (11) lists Agility, then Intellect, and on the live realm a Witch Hunter received Agility gear from Spoils and Caches, with Intellect at most as a lesser stat. The cache prefers items whose strongest of Strength, Agility, Intellect and Spirit is the first listed attribute, so after eight opens no reward may have a stronger attribute than Agility. Over 40% of the Mythic 1 items a Houndmaster may wear have Intellect as their strongest attribute, so a cache that treats every listed stat alike fails this check in about 98 of 100 runs.",
